#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced Batch Mode"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ark; has an advanced batch mode to manage archives without launching a "
"&GUI; interface. This mode allows you to extract or create archives and add "
"files to them."
